    "notes": {
        "7e68316a-c8ed-4ae2-9325-35b9f25ec945": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 656,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ℹ️ Works without a template\n\nCreateProjectFromTemplate calls `POST /projects/{id}/clone.json`, which clones ANY project, so the flow creates a small source project and clones it — no project template needed (the Free plan has none; appmixer2.eu returned [] on 2026-10-14). ListProjectTemplates is only asserted to return a list. On a site with templates you can point templateId at `$[0].id` of ListProjectTemplates instead."
        }
    }
